; Timer of the colour cycle of the twelve crosses
;
; Counts down from 5 in #R$AE4B (active once all 12 crosses are collected, in rooms 24 and 25); at zero it is reloaded
; with 5, the cycle position (the operand of the LD A,0 at #R$AE5A) advances through 0-5 and the attribute of the
; cross tile $4C (#R$CE4C) is set from #R$8553.
@label=CrossFlashTimer
g$8511 DEFB $05
